@# 🏛️ Smart Governance AI - Implementation Plan

## Project: AI-Powered Smart Governance + Regional Language Misinformation Detection Platform

---

## 📋 Overview

A multi-module civic intelligence system with:
1. **Civic Complaint Intelligence Engine** - Categorization, urgency detection, trend analysis
2. **Public Sentiment & Infrastructure Monitoring** - Social media mining, topic modeling
3. **Regional Language Misinformation Detector** - Semantic similarity, paraphrase detection

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Language | Python 3.10+ |
| NLP Models | XLM-RoBERTa, IndicBERT, MuRIL |
| Embeddings | Sentence Transformers (all-MiniLM-L6-v2) |
| Topic Modeling | BERTopic + UMAP + HDBSCAN |
| Vector Search | FAISS |
| Backend | FastAPI + Uvicorn |
| Dashboard | Streamlit |
| Deployment | Docker + docker-compose |

## 📦 Phases

### Phase 1 - Project Setup ✅ (Building Now)
- Create folder structure
- Setup requirements.txt
- Config files

### Phase 2 - Data Collection ⏳ (Need datasets from user)
- Civic complaints dataset (NYC 311 / Indian Civic Issues)
- Fake news dataset (ISOT / LIAR)
- Social media tweets dataset

### Phase 3 - Data Preprocessing
- Text cleaning (URLs, emojis, special chars, duplicates)
- Multilingual normalization (Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, English)
- HuggingFace tokenization

### Phase 4 - Embedding Generation
- Sentence Transformer embeddings (384-dim with MiniLM)
- Save as .npy files

### Phase 5 - Complaint Clustering (BERTopic)
- UMAP → HDBSCAN → BERTopic pipeline
- Auto-discover complaint categories

### Phase 6 - Urgency Detection Model
- Fine-tune XLM-RoBERTa for 4-class classification
- Classes: LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, CRITICAL

### Phase 7 - Misinformation Detection
- Semantic similarity with FAISS
- Paraphrase detection pipeline

### Phase 8 - Vector Database (FAISS)
- Index complaint & news embeddings
- Enable semantic search

### Phase 9 - FastAPI Backend
- `/predict-topic` - Complaint category
- `/predict-urgency` - Urgency level
- `/similar-news` - Fake news similarity
- `/analyze-text` - Full pipeline analysis

### Phase 10 - Streamlit Dashboard
- Complaint upload & analysis
- Real-time predictions
- Topic distribution charts
- Fake news detection alerts
- Regional heatmaps

### Phase 11-14 - Model Saving, Deployment, Testing, Documentation

## 🎯 Current Status

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Building Phase 1 (Project Setup) + Phase 3 (Preprocessing) + Phase 9 (FastAPI) + Phase 10 (Dashboard) now.
> **Datasets needed from user for Phase 2.**
